      "mergeID": "6a68cea2f5fc3ddd345ceb94",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When I update my VRChat bio on the website, the changes don't appear in the actual game. My website bio and in-game bio are showing two different versions of my bio. I've tried updating and syncing them multiple times, but the in-game bio never changes. I've been trying to fix this, but nothing seems to work.",
